Claude plugins: MCP servers from an .mcp.json path, LSP servers from a root .lsp.json

A plugin.json that names its MCP servers file ("mcpServers": "./.mcp.json")
got the whole file as its server map, so the servers ended up nested under
one server called "mcpServers"; the file's own `mcpServers` object is used
now (a plain map of servers still works). Claude Code also reads a root
`.lsp.json` when plugin.json declares no lspServers; the converter now
records that file, so the plugin's LSP servers load (with --experimental-lsp).

